@example
let p1 x =
  let r = ref [ x ] in
  r := x :: [ 2 ];
  !r

let p2 x =
  let r = ref [ x ] in
  let p e = e; !r in
  p (r := x :: [ 2 ])
@end example

What are the values of @code{p1 1} and @code{p2 1} with the alternative
clause?  What are they with the clause of @code{Sec_4_2}?

@item
